-- GASP dataset opportunity (snapshot; Opportunity). snapshot rows on month starts, month ends and the period bounds shifted back by one, three, six and twelve months
-- Generated from the GASP test fixture (gasp-wiki-mcp/test/fixture/generate.ts, seed 20260101) by npm run conformance.
CREATE TABLE gasp.opportunity (
  advanced_to_next_stage BOOLEAN,
  channel VARCHAR(1000),
  close_date DATE,
  close_date_valid BOOLEAN,
  customer_id VARCHAR(1000),
  forecast_category VARCHAR(1000),
  includes_services BOOLEAN,
  lead_id VARCHAR(1000),
  marketing_influenced BOOLEAN,
  marketing_source VARCHAR(1000),
  opportunity_amount DECIMAL(18, 6),
  opportunity_created_date DATE,
  opportunity_id VARCHAR(1000),
  opportunity_stage VARCHAR(1000),
  partner_id VARCHAR(1000),
  partner_sourced BOOLEAN,
  rep_id VARCHAR(1000),
  required_fields_complete BOOLEAN,
  revenue_type VARCHAR(1000),
  snapshot_date DATE,
  stage_accurate BOOLEAN,
  stage_probability DECIMAL(18, 6),
  updated_within_sla BOOLEAN
);
